del to a file."],"id":"a373c2f1"},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":33,"id":"ZNjhDi3RL9p8","metadata":{"id":"ZNjhDi3RL9p8","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1785127461031,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":32,"user":{"displayName":"Karthika P","userId":"09834707494262195163"}}},"outputs":[],"source":["# Retrieving word vectors for all the words present in the model's vocabulary\n","vec_size = model_w2v.vector_size\n","words = list(model_w2v.wv.index_to_key)\n","\n","# Creating a dictionary of words and their corresponding vectors\n","word_vector_dict = {word: model_w2v.wv[word] for word in words}"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"876d9a30"},"source":["This cell retrieves the word vectors for all words present in the trained Word2Vec model's vocabulary and stores them in a dictionary `word_vector_dict`."],"id":"876d9a30"},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":34,"id":"UrlTewOEMDtB","metadata":{"id":"UrlTewOEMDtB","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1785127462800,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":40,"user":{"displayName":"Karthika P","userId":"09834707494262195163"}}},"outputs":[],"source":["def average_vectorizer_Word2Vec(doc):\n","    # Initializing a feature vector for the sentence\n","    feature_vector = np.zeros((vec_size,), dtype=\"float64\")\n","\n","    # Creating a list of words in the sentence that are present in the model vocabulary\n","    words_in_vocab = [word for word in doc.split() if word in words]\n","\n","    # adding the vector representations of the words\n","    for word in words_in_vocab:\n","        feature_vector += np.array(word_vector_dict[word])\n","\n","    # Dividing by the number of words to get the average vector\n","    if len(words_in_vocab) != 0:\n","        feature_vector /= len(words_in_vocab)\n","\n","    return feature_vector"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"1e2727fe"},"source":["This cell defines a function `average_vectorizer_Word2Vec` that takes a document (news article) as input, averages the Word2Vec