oads it. This step is essential because the subsequent prediction task for unseen data relies on generating embeddings using this specific model, which was identified as a strong performer in the neural network setting."],"id":"a643cc8e"},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"220ce919","outputId":"11ce2b76-4fd6-49f8-e1d6-0ac11c04a3b3","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1785127751319,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":1129,"user":{"displayName":"Karthika P","userId":"09834707494262195163"}}},"source":["if unseen_embedding_model:\n","    # Define unseen_news as a list of example news articles for prediction\n","    # Replace these with your actual unseen news articles\n","    unseen_news = [\n","        \"Apple announced record profits this quarter, boosting investor confidence.\",\n","        \"Global economic slowdown concerns are impacting tech stock performance.\",\n","        \"New product launch from a competitor has created uncertainty in the market.\"\n","    ]\n","\n","    unseen_news_embeddings = unseen_embedding_model.encode(unseen_news)\n","    print(\"Embeddings generated for unseen news.\")\n","else:\n","    unseen_news_embeddings = None\n","    print(\"Cannot generate embeddings as the SentenceTransformer model failed to load.\")"],"execution_count":79,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Embeddings generated for unseen news.\n"]}],"id":"220ce919"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"74820d8e"},"source":["This cell generates embeddings for the `unseen_news` articles using the loaded `unseen_embedding_model` (BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5 SentenceTransformer). Each unseen news article is transformed into a numerical vector representation, which is the required input format for our trained neural network model to make sentiment predictions."],"id":"74820d8e"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"765b28a7"},"source":["This cell performs the final prediction step for the unseen news articles. It converts the unseen news embeddings to a TensorFlow tensor, feeds them into the `baai_nn_model` (the best-performing Neural Network trained with BAAI embeddings), and converts the predicted probabilities back into the original sentiment labels (-1, 0, 1). The results are then displayed in a pandas DataFrame, showing each news article alongside its predicted sentiment, demonstrating the model's capability to provide actionable insights for new data."],"id":"765b28a7"},{"cell_type":"code","source":[],"metadata":{"id":"BEiTKTR86iPw"},"id":"BEiTKTR86iPw","execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":196},"id":"3e698491","outputId":"f1116a56-6cff-4883-9685-22c16f4208a8","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1785128015361,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":222,"user":{"displayName":"Karthika P","userId":"09834707494262195163"}}},"source":["import pandas as pd # Import pandas for DataFrame creation\n","\n","if unseen_news_embeddings is not None:\n","    # The best performing Neural Network model (trained with BAAI embeddings) is stored in 'model'.\n","    # Convert embeddings to TensorFlow tensor\n","    unseen_news_embeddings_tf = tf.convert_to_tensor(unseen_news_embeddings, dtype=tf.float32)\n","\n","    # Predict sentiment probabilities using the correct model (model)\n","    unseen_predictions_probs = model.predict(unseen_news_embeddings_tf)\n","\n","    # Convert probabilities to class labels\n","    unseen_predictions = np.argmax(unseen_predictions_probs, axis=1)\n","\n","    # Map numerical predictions back to original sentiment labels\n","    # The label mapping was {-1: 0, 0: 1, 1: 2}, so reverse is {0: -1, 1: 0, 2: 1}\n","    reverse_label_map = {0: -1, 1: 0, 2: 1}\n","    predicted_sentiments = [reverse_label_map[pred] for pred in unseen_predictions]\n","\n","    # Display results\n","    results = pd.DataFrame({\n","        'News Article': unseen_news,\n","        'Predicted Sentiment': predicted_sentiments\n","    })\n","    print(\"\\nPredicted sentiments for unseen news articles:\")\n","    display(results)\n","else:\n","    print(\"Skipping prediction as embeddings could not be generated.\")"],"execution_count":88,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\u001b[1m1/1\u001b[0m \u001b[32m━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[0m \u001b[1m0s\u001b[0m 93ms/step\n","\n","Predicted sentiments for unseen news articles:\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["                                                                  News Article  \\\n","0   Apple announced record profits this quarter, boosting investor confidence.   \n","1      Global economic slowdown concerns are impacting tech stock performance.   \n","2  New product launch from a competitor has created uncertainty in the market.   \n","\n","   Predicted Sentiment  \n","0                    1  \n","1                    1  \n","2                    1  "],"text/html":["\n","  <div id=\"df-7cd7962f-dd97-4ebe-ae4e-ebd10eb19564\" class=\"colab-df-container\">\n","    <div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        vertical-align: middle;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n","        vertical-align: top;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe thead th {\n","        text-align: right;\n","    }\n","</style>\n","<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n","  <thead>\n","    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n","      <th></th>\n","      <th>News Article</th>\n","      <th>Predicted Sentiment</th>\n","    </tr>\n","  </thead>\n","  <tbody>\n","    <tr>\n","      <th>0</th>\n","      <td>Apple announced record profits this quarter, boosting investor confidence.</td>\n","      <td>1</td>\n","    </tr>\n","    <tr>\n","      <th>1</th>\n","      <td>Global economic slowdown concerns are impacting tech stock performance.</td>\n","      <td>1</td>\n","    </tr>\n","    <tr>\n","      <th>2</th>\n","      <td>New